---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { SITE } from "../config";
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description={`Privacy Policy for ${SITE.title}`}>
  <div class="container" style="padding-top: 2rem; padding-bottom: 3rem; max-width: 780px;">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p style="color:var(--gray-500); font-size:0.9rem; margin-bottom:2rem;">
      Last updated: {new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-US', { year: 'numeric', month: 'long', day: 'numeric' })}
    </p>

    <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>
      When you visit {SITE.title}, we may collect the following types of information:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Automatically collected data:</strong> Your IP address, browser type, device information, referring URL, pages visited, and time spent on pages. This is collected through standard server logs and analytics.</li>
      <li><strong>Email address:</strong> When you voluntarily subscribe to our newsletter, we collect your email address to send you updates, guides, and content recommendations.</li>
      <li><strong>Cookies:</strong> We use cookies and similar tracking technologies to enhance your browsing experience, analyze site traffic, and serve relevant advertisements.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
    <p>We use the information we collect to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Operate and maintain the website</li>
      <li>Send you newsletters and content updates (if you've subscribed)</li>
      <li>Analyze site traffic and user behavior to improve our content</li>
      <li>Display relevant advertisements through Google AdSense and affiliate programs</li>
      <li>Prevent fraud and ensure site security</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. Cookies and Tracking</h2>
    <p>
      We use cookies for the following purposes:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Essential cookies:</strong> Required for the website to function properly.</li>
      <li><strong>Analytics cookies:</strong> Help us understand how visitors interact with the site (e.g., Google Analytics, if enabled).</li>
      <li><strong>Advertising cookies:</strong> Used by Google AdSense and affiliate networks to show relevant ads. Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on prior visits.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      You can disable cookies in your browser settings. Visit <a href="https://www.aboutads.info">www.aboutads.info</a> to opt out of interest-based advertising.
    </p>

    <h2>4. Third-Party Services</h2>
    <p>
      We use the following third-party services that may collect data about you:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Google AdSense:</strong> Displays advertisements. Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads based on your visit. View <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google's Privacy Policy</a>.</li>
      <li><strong>Buttondown:</strong> Our newsletter service. When you subscribe, your email is stored by Buttondown. View <a href="https://buttondown.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Buttondown's Privacy Policy</a>.</li>
      <li><strong>Affiliate networks:</strong> Links to third-party retailers may include affiliate tracking. These retailers have their own privacy policies.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>5. Data Sharing</h2>
    <p>
      We do not sell, trade, or rent your personal information to third parties. We may share anonymized, aggregated data for analytics purposes. We will disclose information if required by law or to protect our rights.
    </p>

    <h2>6. Data Retention</h2>
    <p>
      Email addresses collected through our newsletter are retained until you unsubscribe. Server logs and analytics data are retained for up to 26 months.
    </p>

    <h2>7. Your Rights</h2>
    <p>Depending on your jurisdiction, you may have the right to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Access the personal data we hold about you</li>
      <li>Request correction or deletion of your data</li>
      <li>Object to or restrict processing of your data</li>
      <li>Withdraw consent (e.g., unsubscribe from emails)</li>
      <li>Data portability</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      To exercise any of these rights, contact us through the website. You can unsubscribe from our newsletter at any time by clicking the unsubscribe link in any email.
    </p>

    <h2>8. Children's Privacy</h2>
    <p>
      Our website is not directed at children under 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13.
    </p>

    <h2>9. Changes to This Policy</h2>
    <p>
      We may update this privacy policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated date.
    </p>

    <h2>10. Contact</h2>
    <p>
      If you have questions about this privacy policy, please contact us through the <a href="/about">About page</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>